  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NN , har anlitats f&#xF6;r uppdraget att genomf&#xF6;ra en LFA-utbildning f&#xF6;r Quito kommun. Syftet med insatsen &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka organisationens f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga att f&#xF6;rbereda projekt, som skulle komma i fr&#xE5;ga f&#xF6;r KTS-st&#xF6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NN , is contracted to carry out an education in the Logical Framework Approach with the municipality of Quito. The aim of the project is the increase the ability of the organisationin preparing proects that could be presented to Sida in the frame- work of the Contract Financed Technical Cooperation.</narrative>
